{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_deserialize_2.march","start_line":5,"start_col":12,"end_line":5,"end_col":22,"message":"`Cap(IO.Console)` cannot be serialized — a capability may only be received, never constructed.\nhint: `to_json` places no constraint on the type it produces, so it would fabricate authority from data. Receive the capability as a parameter and pass it through instead.","code":"cap_deserialize","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[]}
